### 1. Test PyPI Connectivity
GET http://localhost:3003/api/test-pypi

### 2. Fast Audit (Core Dependencies)
POST http://localhost:3003/api/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requirements": "numpy==1.19.5\nrequests==2.31.0"
}

### 3. Full Research Stack Audit (Data Science & Web)
POST http://localhost:3003/api/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requirements": "numpy==1.19.5\npandas==1.3.0\nrequests==2.31.0\nflask==2.3.0\nseaborn==0.13.2"
}

### 4. Sedentary & Discordant Dependency Audit
POST http://localhost:3003/api/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requirements": "numpy==1.19.5\npymorphy2==0.9.1\nrequests==2.31.0"
}

### 5. Multi-Package Production Stack Audit
POST http://localhost:3003/api/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requirements": "requests==2.32.3\npip==25.1.1\npymongo==4.12.1\nflask==3.0.0\nseaborn==0.13.2"
}
